    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/c69f3d1535cedd29e76f57d9d8b706fa.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exhilarating side-scrolling arcade beat 'em up gameplay\uff0cplayer can switch between <strong><i>Traditional command input</i></strong>  Mode and  <strong><i>simplified command input</i></strong>  mode\uff0cfits all kinds of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/e26773968b86e2246a94941c53e07a6f.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directly seizing the enemy's synthic body for your own use, if it doesn't feel right, no worries! Just switch to a new one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/4b528fc2a2311362d66bda4374bf515c.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPLANTS and DRONES together create hundreds of possible combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When she opened her eyes, everything is so wrong.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where am I? Why I am here? Who is that? Why he called me ChiYo? and\u2026what day is it\uff1f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight! Override! Surgery!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She carried on, moved forward\u2026\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fate of the Children of Tyche\uff1f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The final wish of someone?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And, What is the true truth? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She must find out in this cyberpunk city, the answer will come.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/c69f3d1535cedd29e76f57d9d8b706fa.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exhilarating side-scrolling arcade beat 'em up gameplay\uff0cplayer can switch between <strong><i>Traditional command input</i></strong>  Mode and  <strong><i>simplified command input</i></strong>  mode\uff0cfits all kinds of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/0e0f3a75601bbe15e022e25b2e7673d1.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/e26773968b86e2246a94941c53e07a6f.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directly seizing the enemy's synthic body for your own use, if it doesn't feel right, no worries! Just switch to a new one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/b4eda61a17727f0e07234a14b257ae91.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/4b528fc2a2311362d66bda4374bf515c.webp?t=1752640640\" width=437 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMPLANTS and DRONES together create hundreds of possible combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.poster.avif?t=1752640640\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.webm?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848740/extras/2264631eed159ff151ea349a07194c2c.mp4?t=1752640640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When she opened her eyes, everything is so wrong.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where am I? Why I am here? Who is that? Why he called me ChiYo? and\u2026what day is it\uff1f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight! Override! Surgery!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She carried on, moved forward\u2026\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The fate of the Children of Tyche\uff1f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The final wish of someone?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And, What is the true truth? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She must find out in this cyberpunk city, the answer will come.</i></p>",
